      "line_0": {
        "id": "line_0",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "今天我们来玩《卡卡送》吧，一款互相割据来占领更多地盘的桌游。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_0:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_1": {
        "id": "line_1",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "是零和博弈吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_1:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_2": {
        "id": "line_2",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "看我一统四国。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_2:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_3": {
        "id": "line_3",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "等一下，我需要看完全部规则和攻略才能开始玩。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_3:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_3": {
        "id": "game_time_3",
        "type": "consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_4": {
        "id": "line_4",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "我们又不赌钱，玩儿而已，认真就没意思了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_4:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_5": {
        "id": "line_5",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "放轻松，不会的我教你。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_5:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_6": {
        "id": "line_6",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "别让阿伟久等，他一会儿还要去打工赚钱养耳机。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_6:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_6": {
        "id": "game_time_6",
        "type": "consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_7": {
        "id": "line_7",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "不行，等等，我再看最后一眼……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_7:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_8": {
        "id": "line_8",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "快快藏好主控手机。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_8:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_9": {
        "id": "line_9",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "*游戏进行中",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_9:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_9": {
        "id": "game_time_9",
        "type": "consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_10": {
        "id": "line_10",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "这是谁的人在我地盘上？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_10:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_11": {
        "id": "line_11",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "我的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_11:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_12": {
        "id": "line_12",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "他也挡住我的路了。我的城堡围不起来了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_12:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_12": {
        "id": "game_time_12",
        "type": "consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_13": {
        "id": "line_13",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "你的策略是什么？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_13:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_14": {
        "id": "line_14",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "只要让你们都没法赢，我就不会输了，不是吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_14:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_15": {
        "id": "line_15",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "原来是搅屎棍流。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_15:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_15": {
        "id": "game_time_15",
        "type": "consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_16": {
        "id": "line_16",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "你觉得你能防住我们全部吗？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_16:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_17": {
        "id": "line_17",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "这是我最有可能立于不败之地的办法了，因为一开始我没把握好节奏，晚于你们一步，建自己的城堡已经不可能了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_17:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_18": {
        "id": "line_18",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "不试试怎么知道？你这一上来就放弃了啊。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_18:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_18": {
        "id": "game_time_18",
        "type": "consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_19": {
        "id": "line_19",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "对。只有这样，我才不会被打倒。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_19:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_20": {
        "id": "line_20",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "对未知的恐惧只会招来更多未知。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_20:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_21": {
        "id": "line_21",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "我不在乎。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_21:continue"
        }
      },
